WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:08.000
Wie ist es der Gemeinschaft des Kibbutz gelungen, wieder Halt zu finden?

00:10.600 --> 00:12.466
we know this very well already,

00:12.466 --> 00:15.366
because it’s not our first attack unfortunately...

00:17.966 --> 00:22.700
Something really miraculous happens in those situations.

00:22.700 --> 00:25.433
The people we live next to...

00:25.966 --> 00:29.933
have long stopped being our friends and neighbors,

00:29.933 --> 00:32.833
they are, we are brothers in arms.

00:33.000 --> 00:35.466
We've been through so much together,

00:35.966 --> 00:37.533
I remember,

00:37.533 --> 00:38.533
just in the middle of the night,

00:38.533 --> 00:39.000
sometimes...

00:39.000 --> 00:41.600
people around the world don’t even know about it,

00:41.600 --> 00:44.366
but we have what we call,

00:45.066 --> 00:46.366
we call it

00:47.500 --> 00:50.100
"drizzles"

00:50.200 --> 00:51.300
of rockets...

00:51.300 --> 00:55.266
I can be here in my house and suddenly out of the blue,

00:55.266 --> 00:59.600
there's an attack of rockets coming in and...

00:59.933 --> 01:02.000
sometimes it starts a conflict,

01:02.000 --> 01:02.966
so...

01:02.966 --> 01:05.266
You need to get up in the middle of the night,

01:05.266 --> 01:07.466
pack your children with everything,

01:07.966 --> 01:13.866
find a safe window

01:14.766 --> 01:17.433
when it’s fairly quiet,

01:17.866 --> 01:20.266
and you just get out of the kibbutz.

01:20.500 --> 01:20.800
Now...

01:20.800 --> 01:24.666
there were so many situations in which I found myself,

01:24.666 --> 01:27.766
3am walking with my...

01:27.766 --> 01:30.133
my daughter in my car,

01:30.133 --> 01:32.133
my husband always had to stay here,

01:32.133 --> 01:34.333
because he's manager of...

01:34.333 --> 01:35.500
managing animals,

01:35.500 --> 01:38.266
so you can’t just leave the animals and go,

01:39.766 --> 01:42.500
So, it was always me and my kids,

01:43.133 --> 01:44.500
I remember situations,

01:44.500 --> 01:47.733
crazy situations like 3am,

01:47.733 --> 01:50.866
I'm driving out of the kibbutz with my daughter,

01:51.400 --> 01:52.466
she's...

01:52.466 --> 01:56.466
2 years old and I'm pregnant with my other child,

01:56.766 --> 01:58.500
and I'm driving out of the kibbutz,

01:58.500 --> 01:59.866
and there are rockets.

02:00.666 --> 02:02.400
Rockets passing me and...

02:04.500 --> 02:11.366
Iron Dome, all over my head and I drive and then,

02:12.000 --> 02:13.300
I get a phone call

02:13.300 --> 02:15.166
from a friend from the kibbutz saying,

02:15.200 --> 02:17.566
"I found a place to stay this night".

02:17.566 --> 02:20.466
"I'm saving you a room, waiting for you",

02:22.066 --> 02:23.033
the location...

02:23.500 --> 02:27.100
and I get there and I have everything waiting for me.

02:27.666 --> 02:32.300
This community is unbelievable.

02:32.733 --> 02:34.333
Living here,

02:34.333 --> 02:36.400
when people speak to me,

02:36.400 --> 02:39.166
used to speak to me, all the time about security,

02:40.600 --> 02:42.833
"Do you know your neighbors where you live?",

02:43.100 --> 02:45.366
because I know that I have neighbors,

02:45.600 --> 02:46.933
that will take care of me,

02:46.933 --> 02:47.966
and my children...

02:47.966 --> 02:50.533
just the same as they will take care of them,

02:50.533 --> 02:53.200
and their children. And this is what we have here,

02:53.200 --> 02:58.300
I remember myself during alarms many times,

02:58.600 --> 03:00.300
with my children...

03:02.000 --> 03:03.666
and, other...

03:05.600 --> 03:08.266
children of the kibbutz,

03:08.466 --> 03:11.900
I remember grabbing my child on one hand,

03:11.900 --> 03:14.266
and another child...

03:14.266 --> 03:17.700
one of my neighbors' in another hand running to shelter,

03:18.100 --> 03:21.766
and I think that knowing...

03:23.533 --> 03:28.933
I think that this community lives according to values,

03:28.933 --> 03:31.333
that in many parts of the world are long,

03:31.333 --> 03:32.566
long forgotten...

03:33.200 --> 03:37.333
And this is one of the reasons why it was so hard,

03:37.333 --> 03:41.033
and it is still so hard,

03:41.133 --> 03:44.000
to find a new place or to think about living,

03:44.000 --> 03:45.900
or to think about...

03:45.900 --> 03:49.066
this is a very strong situation.

03:49.366 --> 03:54.200
Now we also understand there could be, after

03:54.200 --> 03:56.600
such a trauma, we could be in a...

03:56.600 --> 03:57.800
a kibbutz assembly...

03:57.800 --> 03:59.500
Sit all together and try to figure out

03:59.500 --> 04:01.200
what to do,

04:01.566 --> 04:06.166
and then somebody will start shouting or do something,

04:06.166 --> 04:09.100
and people understand that it comes from the trauma.

04:09.300 --> 04:11.400
There's a...

04:12.466 --> 04:15.266
certain way of accepting and understanding,

04:15.866 --> 04:17.400
where people are at...

04:18.066 --> 04:20.966
So this community is really unbelievable,

04:21.400 --> 04:22.700
in those things...
